// SR 941.10 — Section 4 Sight Deposits at the Swiss National Bank
// generated by src/parse.py. Do not edit by hand.

:NOTE
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.

:INFO
Art. 10
In accordance with the National Bank Act (NBA) of 23 December 1953, the National Bank shall specify the conditions under which institutions offering payment transaction services may maintain Swiss franc sight deposits.
|

:NOTE
[AS 1954 599, 1979 983, 1993 399, 1997 2252, 1998 2847 Annex No 7, 2000 1144 Annex No 4, 2004 297 No I 6. AS 2004 1985 Annex No I 2]. See now the FA of 3 Oct. 2003 (SR 951.11).

